# Keep the build context small and, more importantly, never let `COPY . .`
# overwrite the Linux node_modules copied from the deps/prod-deps stages with
# local, platform-specific ones (or with nothing on a clean Git checkout).
#
# NOTE: package.json, pnpm-workspace.yaml, pnpm-lock.yaml and .npmrc are NOT
# ignored — the deps stage explicitly COPYs them and the build would fail.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/.turbo
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage
.git
*.log
*.err
*.tsbuildinfo
.env
.env.*
uploads
n8n-workflows